body.text:
Exploit BonfyreQuery as a projection engine rather than a second truth store. The semantic shell needs deterministic ? queries over WorkGraph, FinancialMetabolism, Evidence, ProviderGraph, Time, Authority and named Power state. BonfyreQuery already supports native layer queries plus DuckDB artifact scans.

Create/reuse a typed read-only query-lens ABI so:
- canonical owners expose bounded relations/snapshots with source revision/digest and validity/locality metadata;
- BonfyreQuery may materialize DuckDB/SQLite/cache views for analytics, but every row retains canonical ref + basis revision and is visibly a projection;
- the semantic shell ? operator composes the same lenses rather than maintaining separate query semantics;
- large analytical joins can lower into DuckDB while exact authority/evidence decisions recheck canonical owners;
- stale projection mismatch becomes TraceDivergence/rebuild, never silent truth;
- @work/... |> ?usage |> ?economics and a Query SQL/lens over the same basis return identical semantic IDs/cardinality.

Use this to make agent communication cheaper: a worker can hand another a lens expression + basis digest instead of serializing the underlying rows.
